      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HELLO ELSA (1) goes very well at the course and distance with three wins and a placing from six starts. Below best last time at Q Lakeside (25.80) in a Restricted WIN, finishing a 6 length fifth. Has the ability and should feature. EXPEDITE (2) finds it hard to win but has a consistent overall record, having placed eight of 16 career runs. Has finished in the placings two on end now, the latest when third (29.92) at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Winning chance. ZIPPING ALCARAZ (3) finished well back at Capalaba last time when a 3.5 lengths sixth (20.10) but scored three back at Q Lakeside (25.42). Cannot be underestimated. GOT STYLE (7) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
